<p class="MsoNormal">I hope you had a great Holiday Season and end to 2019!&nbsp;You had previously expressed interest in Memphis Invest and I was just curious if you are still looking into turnkey real-estate investments. We are gearing up for a big 2020, and we want you involved.<br />
<br />
<br />
Now is a perfect time to invest. We have re-branded as REI Nation to reflect our growing company. We are in 7 markets and last year each one appreciated between 4-8+% with positive cash flow. Interest rates are still down and this year we are adding 100 houses a month to our inventory, so I know we&rsquo;ll be able to find something that fits your portfolio.</p>

<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal">Please let me know if you are still interested in building out a portfolio with us, and&nbsp;I hope to hear from you soon.</p>

<p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p>

<p class="MsoNormal">Ben Riley</p>
